becomes no longer applicable, or becomes no longer valid.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A timestamp marking the conclusion of an action,
the ending of an element&#x27;s relevance,
or the intended or unintended termination of either.

